{"ocrText": "167\nAPPEAL  OF  THE  EXECUTIVE  COMMISSION\nOF  THE  PETROGRAD  COMMITTEE\nOF  THE  R.S.D.L.P.(B.)\nIn pursuance of the decision of the C.C. R.S.D.L.P.\npublished yesterday (signed also by the Petrograd Commit-\ntee), the Executive Commission of the Petrograd Committee\nof the R.S.D.L.P. appeals to workers to resume work to-\nmorrow,  i.e.,  on  the  morning  of  July  7.\nThis decision is supported by a meeting of delegates\nfrom  the  factory  staffs  of  Vyborgskaya  Storona.\nExecutive  Commission,  Petrograd  Committee  of  the  R.S.D.L.P.\nWritten  on  July  6  (19),  1917\nFirst  published  in  1928\nPublished  according  to\nin  Lenin  Miscellany  VII\nthe  manuscript", "textLayer": [{"text": "167", "x": 85.69, "y": 6.06, "w": 3.21, "h": 1.56, "fontSize": 9.2}, {"text": "APPEAL", "x": 17.21, "y": 17.99, "w": 11.58, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "OF", "x": 30.25, "y": 17.99, "w": 3.81, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "THE", "x": 35.56, "y": 17.99, "w": 5.92, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "EXECUTIVE", "x": 42.96, "y": 17.99, "w": 16.88, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "COMMISSION", "x": 61.27, "y": 17.99, "w": 19.31, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "OF", "x": 23.91, "y": 20.17, "w": 3.81, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "THE", "x": 29.19, "y": 20.17, "w": 5.92, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "PETROGRAD", "x": 36.59, "y": 20.17, "w": 18.05, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "COMMITTEE", "x": 56.09, "y": 20.17, "w": 17.8, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "OF", "x": 32.8, "y": 22.36, "w": 3.81, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "THE", "x": 38.07, "y": 22.36, "w": 5.92, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "R.S.D.L.P.", "x": 45.45, "y": 22.36, "w": 13.99, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "(", "x": 59.56, "y": 22.19, "w": 1.2, "h": 2.11, "fontSize": 12.5}, {"text": "B.", "x": 60.92, "y": 22.36, "w": 2.73, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": ")", "x": 63.76, "y": 22.19, "w": 1.21, "h": 2.11, "fontSize": 12.5}, {"text": "In pursuance of the decision of the C.C. R.S.D.L.P.", "x": 11.67, "y": 26.94, "w": 77.22, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "published yesterday (signed also by the Petrograd Commit-", "x": 8.89, "y": 28.88, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "tee), the Executive Commission of the Petrograd Committee", "x": 8.89, "y": 30.82, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "of the R.S.D.L.P. appeals to workers to resume work to-", "x": 8.89, "y": 32.76, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "morrow,  i.e.,  on  the  morning  of  July  7.", "x": 8.89, "y": 34.7, "w": 55.87, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "This decision is supported by a meeting of delegates", "x": 11.67, "y": 36.62, "w": 77.23, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "from  the  factory  staffs  of  Vyborgskaya  Storona.", "x": 8.89, "y": 38.56, "w": 67.06, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Executive  Commission,  Petrograd  Committee  of  the  R.", "x": 8.89, "y": 42.45, "w": 70.05, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "S", "x": 78.87, "y": 42.53, "w": 1.62, "h": 1.76, "fontSize": 10.4}, {"text": ".D.L.P.", "x": 80.5, "y": 42.45, "w": 8.39, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Written", "x": 8.95, "y": 46.31, "w": 7.58, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "on", "x": 17.42, "y": 46.31, "w": 2.27, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "July", "x": 20.62, "y": 46.31, "w": 3.99, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "6", "x": 25.51, "y": 46.36, "w": 0.95, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": "(", "x": 27.5, "y": 46.31, "w": 0.67, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "19", "x": 28.3, "y": 46.36, "w": 1.91, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": "),", "x": 30.43, "y": 46.31, "w": 1.33, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "1917", "x": 32.65, "y": 46.36, "w": 3.95, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": "First", "x": 11.41, "y": 48.17, "w": 4.65, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "published", "x": 16